<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-sanguozhi" book-id="b-sanguozhi-050" chapter-id="c-sanguozhi-050-langya-wang" source-id="s-sanguozhi-050-langya-wang">
  <p id="c-sanguozhi-050-langya-wang:line040" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">吳主<persName id="c-sanguozhi-050-langya-wang:line040:m0002" ref="572_278_cba">權</persName><persName id="c-sanguozhi-050-langya-wang:line040:m0003" ref="rtv_1n1_nx2">王夫人</persName>，琅邪人也。夫人以選入宮，黃武中得幸，生（孫）<persName id="c-sanguozhi-050-langya-wang:line040:m0029" ref="572_278_cba_A">和</persName>，寵次<persName id="c-sanguozhi-050-langya-wang:line040:m0033" ref="8xo_xnf_f5a">步氏</persName>。<persName id="c-sanguozhi-050-langya-wang:line040:m0036" ref="8xo_xnf_f5a">步氏</persName>薨後，<persName id="c-sanguozhi-050-langya-wang:line040:m0041" ref="572_278_cba_A">和</persName>立為太子，<persName id="c-sanguozhi-050-langya-wang:line040:m0047" ref="572_278_cba">權</persName>將立夫人為后，而<persName id="c-sanguozhi-050-langya-wang:line040:m0056" ref="xpt_euv_2zx">全公主</persName>素憎夫人，稍稍譖毀。及<persName id="c-sanguozhi-050-langya-wang:line040:m0070" ref="572_278_cba">權</persName>寢疾。言有喜色，由是<persName id="c-sanguozhi-050-langya-wang:line040:m0081" ref="572_278_cba">權</persName>深責怒，以憂死。<persName id="c-sanguozhi-050-langya-wang:line040:m0090" ref="572_278_cba_A">和</persName>子<persName id="c-sanguozhi-050-langya-wang:line040:m0092" ref="05e_9bb_55a">皓</persName>立，追尊夫人曰大懿皇后，封三弟皆列侯。</p>
  <p id="c-sanguozhi-050-langya-wang:line040-pei01-01" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_pei_songzhi_note">《吳書》曰：<persName id="c-sanguozhi-050-langya-wang:line040-pei01-01:m0006" ref="rtv_1n1_nx2">夫人</persName>父名<persName id="c-sanguozhi-050-langya-wang:line040-pei01-01:m0010" ref="kt3_nto_6zk">盧九</persName>。</p>
</text>
